{"content":[{"c":["JAHATH"],"sourceClass":"h1","t":"p"},{"c":["1. Reaiah’s son and the father of Ahumai and Lahad, Zorathites from Judah’s tribe (",{"href":"?bref=1Chr.4.2","r":"1Chr.4.2","rawR":"1Chr.4.2","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"1Chr.4.2","value":"1Chr.4.2"}],"t":"ref","v":"1 Chr 4:2"},")."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"},{"c":["2. Gershonite Levite (",{"href":"?bref=1Chr.6.20","r":"1Chr.6.20","rawR":"1Chr.6.20","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"1Chr.6.20","value":"1Chr.6.20"}],"t":"ref","v":"1 Chr 6:20"},"), whose descendant Asaph was appointed by King David to serve as a musician in the temple (v ",{"href":"?bref=1Chr.6.43","r":"1Chr.6.43","rawR":"1Chr.6.43","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"1Chr.6.43","value":"1Chr.6.43"}],"t":"ref","v":"43"},")."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"},{"c":["3. A descendant of Shimei, who was a descendant of Gershon from Levi’s tribe (",{"href":"?bref=1Chr.23.10-11","r":"1Chr.23.10-11","rawR":"1Chr.23.10-11","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"1Chr.23.10-11","value":"1Chr.23.10-11"}],"t":"ref","v":"1 Chr 23:10-11"},")."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"},{"c":["4. Shelomith’s son from Levi’s tribe (",{"href":"?bref=1Chr.24.22","r":"1Chr.24.22","rawR":"1Chr.24.22","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"1Chr.24.22","value":"1Chr.24.22"}],"t":"ref","v":"1 Chr 24:22"},")."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"},{"c":["5. Merarite Levite, who was one of the supervisors of the temple repairs under Josiah (",{"href":"?bref=2Chr.34.12","r":"2Chr.34.12","rawR":"2Chr.34.12","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"2Chr.34.12","value":"2Chr.34.12"}],"t":"ref","v":"2 Chr 34:12"},")."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"}],"format":"bsb-study-dictionary-v2","id":"Jahath","provenance":{"archiveSha256":"10758ea00dbea7540f9337e43e59c8e4000295c1261e3426bab6f31c31dcff5b","release":"1.6","sourceCitationReferences":[{"anchorText":"1 Chr 4:2","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=1Chr.4.2","rawQueryValue":"1Chr.4.2","sourceRefExact":"1Chr.4.2"},{"anchorText":"1 Chr 6:20","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dict